==Description==
Augments {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Plague Zombie}} by increasing Played time whenever a certain amount of {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Plague Zombie}} is spent.

==Details==
Adds 1 second of Pet's Played game time per every time at least

<math>5 - \text{Tier}</math>

charges of {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Plague Zombie}} are spent.

''Note: This is capped at 1 second per {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Plague Zombie}} cast.''


Tiers:
* <math>\text{Common} = 0</math>
* <math>\text{Uncommon} = 1</math>
* <math>\text{Rare} = 2</math>
* <math>\text{Epic} = 3</math>
* <math>\text{Legendary} = 4</math>
* <math>\text{Unique} = 4</math>

